WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:05.330
Doctor Vendar, please give me Ex Machina!

00:05.330 --> 00:06.800
You can forget that.

00:06.800 --> 00:10.760
If I had it, this time I would be able
to destroy Hyrum for sure!

00:11.570 --> 00:15.140
Your hatred of Hyrum is too strong
for your own good.

00:15.140 --> 00:18.650
It will eventually lead you to your destruction.

00:18.650 --> 00:20.440
Doctor Vendar...

00:27.220 --> 00:29.020
I...

00:29.020 --> 00:32.820
I didn't come to this world to
get into fights like this.

00:46.640 --> 00:54.250
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

00:54.250 --> 00:57.420
Utatte iru

00:57.420 --> 01:05.060
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

01:05.060 --> 01:08.330
Shimaikonde

01:08.330 --> 01:18.910
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:18.910 --> 01:24.350
Ayumou

01:24.350 --> 01:29.750
Susumou

01:29.750 --> 01:34.590
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:34.590 --> 01:40.060
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:40.060 --> 01:45.530
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:45.530 --> 01:50.770
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:50.770 --> 01:54.800
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

01:56.440 --> 01:59.970
Atashi wa ikite yuku

02:05.850 --> 02:09.650
Episode 36
Wings Reborn

02:18.100 --> 02:20.400
Do not allow the enemy to gain any ground!

02:20.400 --> 02:22.900
We're going to reclaim the city!

02:22.900 --> 02:24.840
Stop dicking around!

02:24.840 --> 02:26.980
I'm losing my patience here.

02:26.980 --> 02:28.940
Break through their ranks!

02:39.390 --> 02:42.490
Elmeida's and Nudyu's units have made
contact with the enemy in town.

02:42.490 --> 02:44.930
They have engaged in combat.

02:44.930 --> 02:47.160
And how is the battle proceeding?

02:47.160 --> 02:49.060
It is a complete stalemate so far.

02:49.060 --> 02:52.030
The tide of battle continues to
fluctuate between sides.

02:52.670 --> 02:54.640
Useless trash...

03:02.310 --> 03:06.450
Hugh, exactly what do you want to do?

03:06.450 --> 03:09.620
What do you seek to gain from this battle?

03:09.620 --> 03:11.420
Everything.

03:11.420 --> 03:13.720
It will all be mine,

03:13.720 --> 03:17.180
and then I will destroy it all
with my own two hands!

03:21.460 --> 03:25.400
D..Do you think you'll get away with it?

03:25.400 --> 03:27.900
No one is permitted to do that.

03:27.900 --> 03:33.110
If anyone were, it would be Great Tusker
and Great Tusker only.

03:33.110 --> 03:35.840
Then, I'll become...

03:35.840 --> 03:39.880
Or rather, I'll transcend Tusker.

03:39.880 --> 03:41.080
What?!

03:41.080 --> 03:44.210
I will show you my power.

03:50.960 --> 03:53.560
The battle at the front line is at a stalemate.

03:53.560 --> 03:56.230
We are still unable to predict an outcome.

03:56.230 --> 04:00.640
Our forces were trained under Absolute Law!

04:00.640 --> 04:02.570
They are the strongest of all military forces!

04:02.570 --> 04:05.200
They will not by any means lose.

04:12.210 --> 04:13.210
Here they come!

04:13.210 --> 04:15.010
Beastmen from above!

04:29.330 --> 04:30.970
Master Noah!

04:30.970 --> 04:32.770
They will go no farther.

04:32.770 --> 04:34.390
Sachura!

04:41.510 --> 04:44.640
Sagiri, please be all right.

04:50.790 --> 04:54.390
Hey, what's going on?

04:54.390 --> 04:56.190
War.

04:56.560 --> 04:59.330
Why did this happen?

04:59.330 --> 05:01.800
Why is there a war?

05:01.800 --> 05:03.500
Why indeed...

05:03.500 --> 05:07.770
I have lived as a soldier all my life,

05:07.770 --> 05:10.740
so fighting has been my way of life.

05:10.740 --> 05:14.340
I have lived through day after day of fighting.

05:14.340 --> 05:17.750
I don't like the sound of a world like that.

05:17.750 --> 05:21.220
There are so many fun things you can do too.

05:21.220 --> 05:23.180
Phooey on war...

05:25.920 --> 05:27.550
Mister?!

05:30.490 --> 05:31.930
That's as far as we go.

05:31.930 --> 05:34.220
I don't think you'll be in danger anymore.

05:35.100 --> 05:36.600
Go now.

05:36.600 --> 05:39.230
O..Okay...

05:47.580 --> 05:48.710
What's wrong?

05:48.710 --> 05:50.880
Go, quickly!

05:50.880 --> 05:53.850
There's no reason for you to stay here.

05:55.020 --> 05:56.640
But...

05:58.090 --> 05:59.880
I can't go.

06:06.930 --> 06:08.560
Noah...

06:12.730 --> 06:14.340
That damn fool.

06:14.340 --> 06:18.410
The device is not yet ready for normal use.

06:18.410 --> 06:21.710
We cannot predict what might happen.

06:21.710 --> 06:24.710
Ginga, you must stop Helic.

06:24.710 --> 06:28.010
Man, this guy is a lot of trouble.

06:37.590 --> 06:39.720
Ex Machina...

06:41.300 --> 06:43.760
With this I can...

06:48.070 --> 06:49.700
Ginga?

06:49.700 --> 06:51.240
Why are you here?

06:51.240 --> 06:53.440
It's the Doctor's orders.

06:53.440 --> 06:55.880
I'm here to bring you back.

06:55.880 --> 06:58.980
We're going back to Ulvarx, Helic.

06:58.980 --> 07:00.580
Let me tell you something.

07:00.580 --> 07:06.220
Hyrum exiled my entire clan just because
one of us broke his laws.

07:06.220 --> 07:07.520
Not only that,

07:07.520 --> 07:09.960
but he stole my one and only sister from us,

07:09.960 --> 07:12.930
since she had promise as a shard caster!

07:13.560 --> 07:16.530
I swear I will not forgive Hyrum!

07:16.530 --> 07:19.430
You're not the only one who's
dealing with tragedy!

07:19.430 --> 07:21.900
Stop talking like you know it all!

07:25.010 --> 07:27.910
Give that back, Helic.

07:27.910 --> 07:31.210
You don't understand its power at all.

07:33.250 --> 07:35.040
All right...

07:51.870 --> 07:54.490
I'm sorry, Ginga.

07:56.870 --> 08:01.640
We have confirmed shifting energy
near the forest of Nagu.

08:01.640 --> 08:03.510
Enemy reinforcements?

08:03.510 --> 08:07.110
I have already sent Kira to investigate.

08:07.110 --> 08:11.590
Noah has been sent to the front to fill in for Kira.

08:11.590 --> 08:14.210
Yes, very well.

08:21.060 --> 08:22.660
Leave this to me.

08:22.660 --> 08:24.030
Go back up Brian's unit.

08:24.030 --> 08:25.660
Yes, sir!

08:31.470 --> 08:33.110
It's you...

08:33.110 --> 08:34.730
Hugh!

08:35.110 --> 08:37.580
Sachura's master, eh?

08:38.380 --> 08:40.350
I can't bear the sight of you!

08:50.460 --> 08:53.260
You're from Ulvarx, aren't you?

08:54.260 --> 08:55.930
I have no business with small fry.

08:55.930 --> 08:56.500
What?!

08:56.500 --> 08:57.600
Hyrum is the only one I have business with.
What?!

08:57.600 --> 09:00.290
Hyrum is the only one I have business with.

09:15.820 --> 09:18.190
It will all be mine!

09:18.190 --> 09:20.220
I will destroy any who interfere!

09:20.220 --> 09:23.680
I will protect Neotopia!

09:40.880 --> 09:43.840
Here, have some water and feel better.

09:50.050 --> 09:51.320
It's good.

09:51.320 --> 09:53.220
Great!

09:53.220 --> 09:55.190
Okay, now this.

10:45.570 --> 10:47.240
A harmonica?

10:47.240 --> 10:50.210
Who would be playing now of all times?

11:00.760 --> 11:02.550
My strength...

11:03.660 --> 11:05.960
I'll put an end to you.

11:12.470 --> 11:14.740
Just a little bit more and I would have had him.

11:14.740 --> 11:17.030
How could I be unable to finish him?

11:19.470 --> 11:21.440
Zed?

11:21.980 --> 11:24.080
Someone you know?

11:24.080 --> 11:25.980
Go!

11:25.980 --> 11:26.980
But...

11:26.980 --> 11:29.610
I'll have to be leaving soon too.

11:30.580 --> 11:32.220
Okay...

11:32.220 --> 11:33.750
Thank you!

11:33.750 --> 11:35.550
Take care!

12:05.490 --> 12:10.120
I won't forgive Hyrum or Absolute Law

12:10.120 --> 12:11.960
for taking away everything dear to me!

12:11.960 --> 12:13.760
Enough of your nonsense!

12:16.430 --> 12:19.800
I will use my power to overthrow Absolute Law!

12:19.800 --> 12:23.740
I have lived to overthrow Absolute Law.

12:23.740 --> 12:27.110
I have lived under the protection of Absolute Law!

12:27.110 --> 12:30.180
And now, it is my turn to protect it!

12:30.180 --> 12:31.800
Buvaris!

12:36.280 --> 12:38.080
Now watch...

12:39.550 --> 12:43.010
This is the power of Ulvarx!

12:48.660 --> 12:50.630
Wh..What is this?

13:04.510 --> 13:09.970
You fools act as Hyrum's agents,
without ever thinking on your own.

13:14.220 --> 13:16.190
Th..That's...

13:33.640 --> 13:36.110
It... It can't be...

13:49.490 --> 13:53.120
I see, you got mixed up in the battle too, huh?

13:54.160 --> 13:56.060
Yeah...

13:56.060 --> 13:58.030
I want to see Noah.

13:58.930 --> 14:02.390
All right then, I'll get you to Noah.

14:03.470 --> 14:04.770
Really?

14:04.770 --> 14:06.400
Yeah...

14:09.110 --> 14:11.240
Thanks, Zed!

14:17.650 --> 14:19.780
What is that?

14:23.360 --> 14:27.490
I..Is this an enemy spirit?

14:54.050 --> 14:56.160
She is my sister after all.

14:56.160 --> 14:59.280
Chelsia, how can this be?!

15:00.390 --> 15:04.350
How could we meet again like this?

15:11.340 --> 15:14.800
Forgive me, Chelsia.

15:20.010 --> 15:23.140
Br..Brother...

15:47.840 --> 15:50.810
Let go! Let go of me!

15:55.920 --> 15:57.450
Stop...

15:57.450 --> 15:59.420
Stop this!

15:59.990 --> 16:02.620
Return, Ex Machina!

16:19.070 --> 16:20.870
Hey! Are you okay?

16:22.940 --> 16:24.950
Helic, it's you!

16:24.950 --> 16:27.410
Z..Zed?

16:27.410 --> 16:32.850
It looks like I've done a terrible thing.

16:32.850 --> 16:35.690
What the hell is that thing?

16:35.690 --> 16:40.330
Ex Machina, it's a composite of several spirits.

16:40.330 --> 16:41.860
Composite?

16:41.860 --> 16:43.830
You released that spirit?

16:43.830 --> 16:49.170
Yes, but it won't obey me now.

16:49.170 --> 16:52.710
It started on a rampage entirely
of its own free will.

16:52.710 --> 16:57.950
I wanted revenge on Hyrum,

16:57.950 --> 17:03.380
because Absolute Law brings people misfortune.

17:03.380 --> 17:05.180
But instead I've...

17:06.150 --> 17:09.260
Hey, hang on, man.

17:09.260 --> 17:10.990
I'm sorry.

17:10.990 --> 17:13.660
Please, Zed,

17:13.660 --> 17:18.290
stop Ex Machina.

17:21.800 --> 17:25.430
I'm sorry, Chelsia...

17:27.370 --> 17:29.000
Helic!

17:29.410 --> 17:30.880
Helic!

17:30.880 --> 17:33.510
Hang on, Helic!

17:39.090 --> 17:40.880
Helic...

17:49.430 --> 17:51.670
We have received a report.

17:51.670 --> 17:55.900
It seems Ulvarx has released a
previously unknown spirit.

17:55.900 --> 17:58.870
What? Ulvarx?!

17:58.870 --> 18:03.610
The spirit is currently advancing towards
the first defensive wall.

18:03.610 --> 18:08.070
It has dreadful power beyond anything
ordinary spirits can handle.

18:08.680 --> 18:11.320
Send Noah out at once.

18:11.320 --> 18:12.590
Yes, Your Holiness.

18:12.590 --> 18:16.590
What?! Geh-Geh's unit was obliterated?!

18:16.590 --> 18:19.230
Was it a new kind of Neotopian spirit?

18:19.230 --> 18:24.360
Actually, the unknown spirit is attacking
both sides indiscriminately.

18:24.360 --> 18:25.770
What is the meaning of this?

18:25.770 --> 18:28.890
I believe it will reach headquarters
within minutes.

18:31.540 --> 18:32.770
Damn it!

18:32.770 --> 18:35.240
Yet another hindrance.

18:43.050 --> 18:44.680
Rambos!

18:57.870 --> 18:59.660
It got Rambos!

19:03.570 --> 19:05.110
Sachura?

19:05.110 --> 19:07.510
Is this Ulvarx's spirit?

19:07.510 --> 19:08.340
Noah!

19:08.340 --> 19:10.310
It's massive!
Noah!

19:10.310 --> 19:12.810
It's supposedly a composite spirit.

19:12.810 --> 19:14.380
Composite?

19:14.380 --> 19:15.780
Who's its shard caster?

19:15.780 --> 19:17.920
Helic of Ulvarx.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.620
He's dead though.

19:19.620 --> 19:22.090
And the spirit isn't vanishing?

19:23.390 --> 19:25.860
He said it's gone out of control.

19:27.090 --> 19:30.360
Zed, are you still unable to call out Amir Gaul?

19:30.360 --> 19:32.600
Doesn't look like I can yet.

19:32.600 --> 19:34.570
Then stand back.

19:34.570 --> 19:37.870
You can't defeat this enemy with ordinary spirits.

19:41.010 --> 19:42.640
Noah...

20:00.290 --> 20:02.430
How foolish, Helic.

20:02.430 --> 20:04.230
You're a fool!

20:20.080 --> 20:21.980
This spirit is unbelievable!

20:21.980 --> 20:24.110
Even Sachura is no match for it!

20:32.830 --> 20:34.450
Pronimo?

20:45.610 --> 20:48.070
Hugh, you...

20:49.140 --> 20:52.940
To think that we'd end up defeating
that thing together...

21:01.960 --> 21:06.420
Is the whole world going to be
at war from now on?

21:06.930 --> 21:11.390
If that happens, will I be all alone again?

21:12.730 --> 21:17.190
Will you and Noah go away on me too?

21:18.170 --> 21:20.410
I don't...

21:20.410 --> 21:22.200
I don't want that!

21:23.110 --> 21:24.910
I don't want that!

21:31.020 --> 21:33.990
Don't you worry, Sagiri.

21:35.490 --> 21:38.120
I won't let you end up alone.

21:39.730 --> 21:41.350
Zed...

21:43.500 --> 21:47.300
These battles, this war...

21:47.530 --> 21:50.160
I'll bring it all to an end!

21:59.950 --> 22:01.570
Amir Gaul!

22:04.790 --> 22:06.190
Amir Gaul!

22:06.190 --> 22:07.810
What?!

22:10.120 --> 22:13.330
So, he awakened, did he, Zed?

22:13.330 --> 22:15.260
Amir Gaul...

22:15.260 --> 22:18.060
Why would he have changed color?

22:18.730 --> 22:20.860
Let's do it, Amir Gaul!

22:23.140 --> 22:25.110
Go, Sachura!

22:25.110 --> 22:26.730
Pronimo!

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:12.050
My old days kawarazu sawagu weekend

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Tada tanoshikute muchi de rikutsunuki de

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days matatakuma no tsukihi de

23:19.760 --> 23:24.030
Mina ano hi kara hanare sorezore mezashiteru

23:24.030 --> 23:26.700
Otona ni natte omoide wa mune te o futte

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Mukau saki o mitsume

23:27.870 --> 23:31.510
Tatakatteru sugata omotte makenai otagai mae ni

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
Soba ni inakute mo kamawanai

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
Egao mitakute mo ima ja nai

23:35.580 --> 23:37.580
Furikaeru hodo " ltsuka miseru" to

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
ltsumade mo kawaranai

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Tatoe hanareteta to shite mo

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Omoi wa tsunagareteru yo

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
Kono saki mo itsumade demo

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
Zutto zutto hikatte itakute (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
Kagayaite itakute (stay gold)

24:17.550 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
The Fall of the Capital

24:18.350 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "The Fall of the Capital"
